
<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
        <span class="govuk-caption-l">HN2000154 sdf, asdf</span>

        <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">Distribution networks and substations</h1>
        <p class="govuk-body"><strong>Substations</strong></p>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            A substation is a connection between distribution networks which contains
            an exchange of thermal energy (for example, via plate heat exchangers)
            together with other necessary equipment.
        </p>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            Each substation you add to a district distribution network (the supplying
            pipework) splits it into separate sections. Each section is treated as a
            separate district distribution network.
        </p>
        <p class="govuk-body">
            For example, if you have one substation, you will have two district distribution
            network sections. If you have two substations, you will have three district
            distribution network sections.
        </p>
        <div class="govuk-form-group">
            <fieldset class="govuk-fieldset">
                <legend class="govuk-fieldset__legend govuk-fieldset__legend--m">
                    Do you have any district substations in your network?
                </legend>
                <div class="govuk-radios" data-module="govuk-radios" data-govuk-radios-init="">

                    <div class="govuk-radios__item">
                        <input class="govuk-radios__input" id="hasDistrictSubstation" name="hasDistrictSubstation" type="radio" value="yes" aria-controls="conditional-hasDistrictSubstation" aria-expanded="false">
                        <label class="govuk-label govuk-radios__label" for="hasDistrictSubstation">
                            Yes
                        </label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="govuk-radios__conditional govuk-radios__conditional--hidden" id="conditional-hasDistrictSubstation">
                        <div class="govuk-form-group">
                            <label class="govuk-label" for="no-of-thermal-substation">
                                Number of substations
                            </label>
                            <input class="govuk-input govuk-input--width-3" id="no-of-thermal-substation" name="noOfThermalSubstation" type="number" value="">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="govuk-radios__item">
                        <input class="govuk-radios__input" id="hasDistrictSubstation-2" name="hasDistrictSubstation" type="radio" value="no" checked="">
                        <label class="govuk-label govuk-radios__label" for="hasDistrictSubstation-2">
                            No
                        </label>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </fieldset>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="govuk-button" data-module="govuk-button" data-govuk-button-init="">
            Continue
        </button>
    </div>
</div>